# Next.js standalone tracing resolves these through pnpm's .pnpm symlink farm.
# When they are only reachable as symlinks, `next build` fails while materialising
# the standalone tree with ENOENT on the symlink target (seen with @next/env and
# styled-jsx). Hoisting them gives the tracer a real directory to copy.
#
# EXTRA_STANDALONE_DEPS in electron/scripts/build-frontend.mjs also copies them
# post-build; this fixes the failure that happens *during* the build.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@next/env
public-hoist-pattern[]=styled-jsx
